# mdBook output, and the CHANGELOG copied into the book source at build time.
# `docs/src/SUMMARY.md` and `docs/assets/wirescript-hljs.js` are generated too,
# but tracked: CI builds the book without running the generators, and
# `just doc-check` fails when either has drifted from its source.
docs/book/
docs/src/CHANGELOG.md
